    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n10 Block 15 Gallery Quay is wonderfully presented one-bedroom apartment which has been tastefully decorated, ideally positioned on the 4th floor of this development with a bright west-facing aspect overlooking the city. This attractive apartment is an ideal purchase for those seeking a stylish city centre residence or indeed a strong investment opportunity. This fine apartment also benefits from a designated parking space.The accommodation of apartment 10 comprises; a warm and welcoming entrance hall with access to a generous storage room, a bright and spacious open plan living/dining room, with the well-appointed kitchen positioned to the rear. The large west facing balcony is accessible from the living/dining room where one can enjoy 'al fresco dining' late into the evening sun. The generous double bedroom and modern bathroom complete the accommodation. Gallery Quay is superbly located in one of Dublin's most sought-after areas, with a host of amenities on its doorstep including the Bord Gáis Energy Theatre, 3Arena, Aviva Stadium, and a wide range of cafés, bars, and restaurants. Grand Canal Dock offers a vibrant waterside setting, blending modern architecture with historic charm, while hosting many leading international employers. The IFSC, Trinity College, RCSI, and Grafton Street are all within walking distance, with UCD easily accessible by bus. The area is exceptionally well connected, with Grand Canal Dock DART station, multiple Dublin Bus routes, Dublin Bikes, and both Luas lines nearby. Dublin Airport is approximately 20 minutes away by car."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.101m x 1.974m\nWarm and welcoming entrance hall, filled with natural light through the glass panelled door to the living/dining room. There is also access to separate storage room.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 4.753m x 3.443m\nBright, west-facing reception room with floor-to-ceiling windows that flood the room with natural light while also offering unrivalled views across the rooftops of the city centre. This generously proportioned room benefits from dirrect access to the private terrace and is open to the kitchen at the rear.\n\nKitchen - 2.921m x 1.956m\nWell-appointed modern kitchen off the living/dining room with ample storage in the floor and wall-mounted cupboards, complete with integrated appliances that include the fridge/freezer, washing machine, and dishwasher.\n\nBedroom - 3.565m x 3.719m\nBright and spacious double bedroom with expansive views across the city, and with built-in wardrobes and carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.362m x 1.917m\nFully tiled main batroom with wc, hhb, mirrored vanity storage cupboards, and bath with a shower.\n\nBalcony - 5.585m x 1.439m\nPositioned off the living/dining room, the generously proportioned west-facing balcony takes in stunning views across the rooftops of Pearse Square towards the city.\n\nStorage - 0.661m x 1.519m\n\n\n"
      },
